  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Alkhidmat Foundation intends to provide educational opportunities to street children through a sophisticated system of more than 50 learning centers across Pakistan. These Children are either born unprivileged or due to economic conditions are forced to work in their childhood under harsh conditions. Children Protection Centers are the continuity of AKFP&apos;s effort to support weak and vulnerable segments of the society.</narrative>
  </description>
